<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Emphasis and Italics </title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Emphasis vs Italics</h1>

  <p>This sentence uses <em>emphasis</em> to stress the importance of certain words.</p>

  <p>This sentence uses <i>italics</i> just to style the text differently.</p>

  <p>You can even combine them: <em><i>This is important and also styled in italics</i></em>.</p>
</body>
</html>
